92
00:08:21,580 --> 00:08:23,274
¡Di que me has entendido!

93
00:08:25,454 --> 00:08:26,579
Sí.

94
00:08:27,978 --> 00:08:30,454
Escuchad. Tienes

95
00:08:30,911 --> 00:08:33,118
- mi palabra...
- ¡Me importa una mierda tu palabra!

96
00:08:36,467 --> 00:08:38,703
